    1:				; 8051 CALCULATOR V3 - DISPLAY CONTROLLER, UART TWO-WIRE LINK
    2:				; Controller 2 owns the 16x2 LCD and all presentation formatting.
    3:				; Receives semantic events and result/error data from process controller.
    4:
